# Transfer to China

**Buyers only.** Entry is the **Transfer to China** pill on the top-right of the orange wallet balance card (web + app). Do not put this on Withdrawal.

**Alipay only.** Do not add WeChat Pay to this flow.

Admin configures:
- GHS → RMB rate (stored as GHS per 1 RMB, with history and rate lock on each transfer)
- Fees, min/max, daily/monthly limits
- GHS payment methods (MoMo / bank)
- Dynamic form fields (recipient + payment proof)

User flow: see rate → enter Alipay details → pay GHS to admin → upload proof → track status → receive RMB proof.

Completed financial values are immutable. Completing requires RMB transfer proof from admin.
